  "prefLabel": "Acp 403.05 Reciprocal Discipline",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 403.05 Reciprocal Discipline. When the board receives notice that a licensee has been subjected to suspension or revocation of a license without subsequent reinstatement, the board shall issue an order directing the licensee to demonstrate why reciprocal discipline should not be imposed in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #7871-B, eff 4-14-03; ss by #10004, INTERIM, eff 9-22-11, EXPIRED: 3-20-12\n\nNew. #10158, eff 6-27-12 (formerly Acp 220.05); ss by #13578, eff 5-8-23",
